<title>CANADA: TENNIS-CANADIAN OPEN RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-CANADIAN OPEN RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the $2.3 million</p>
<p>Canadian Open men's tennis tournament on Friday (prefix number</p>
<p>denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Quarter-finals</p>
<p>1-Michael Chang (U.S.) beat 8-Richard Krajicek (Netherlands)</p>
<p>7-6 (7-5) 6-4</p>
<p>4-Yevgeny Kafelnikov (Russia) beat 5-Thomas Enqvist (Sweden)</p>
<p>7-5 6-7 (7-9) 6-1</p>
<p>6-Gustavo Kuerten (Brazil) beat Fabrice Santoro (France) 6-3</p>
<p>7-6 (8-6)</p>
<p>Chris Woodruff (U.S.) beat 7-Mark Philippoussis (Australia)</p>
<p>6-4 6-4</p>
</text>
